  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: 
    Lines:
    - "B\u1EA7u tr\u1EDDi u \xE1m. S\xF3ng tri\u1EC1u d\xE2ng v\u1ED7 \u1EA7m \xE0o.
      Gi\u1EEFa kh\xFAc s\xF4ng hi\u1EC3m tr\u1EDF, nh\u1EEFng h\xE0ng c\u1ECDc g\u1ED7
      nh\u1ECDn ho\u1EAFt c\u1EAFm ng\u1EA7m d\u01B0\u1EDBi m\u1EB7t n\u01B0\u1EDBc,
      ch\u1EC9 ch\u1EDD con n\u01B0\u1EDBc r\xFAt \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1ED9 ra nanh s\xF3i.
      Ti\u1EBFng tr\u1ED1ng tr\u1EADn d\u1ED3n d\u1EADp vang v\u1ECDng. T\u1EEB b\u1EDD
      s\xF4ng, d\xE2n binh Giao Ch\xE2u h\xF2 reo ti\u1EBFp s\u1EE9c. Tr\xEAn m\u0169i
      thuy\u1EC1n ch\u1EC9 huy, Ng\xF4 Quy\u1EC1n gi\u01B0\u01A1ng cao ng\u1ECDn
      gi\xE1o, m\u1EAFt nh\xECn th\u1EB3ng v\u1EC1 \u0111o\xE0n chi\u1EBFn thuy\u1EC1n
      Nam H\xE1n \u0111ang \xE0o \u1EA1t x\xF4ng t\u1EDBi."
